(400,185,$mw$62B5FFDF2DC860D01711AB4880CF5044525E66AB4D40C28C2C0B75BAA205A5A4$mw$,$mw$dbbc71ccfeec4020c753c2685d50a5fe$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":185,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":33,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب 21 × 7.","TitleEn":"Compute 21 × 7.","QuestionTextAr":"احسب 21 × 7.","QuestionTextEn":"Compute 21 × 7.","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: خاصية التوزيع والقيمة المكانية. نفكك 21 إلى 20 + 1، فنحسب 21 × 7 = (20 × 7) + (1 × 7) = 140 + 7 = 147. النتيجة 147.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Distributive property and place value. Write 21 = 20 + 1, so 21 × 7 = (20 × 7) + (1 × 7) = 140 + 7 = 147. Answer: 147.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":729,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"148","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":730,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"150","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":731,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"145","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":732,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"147","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"جزّئ العامل الأول إلى عشرات وآحاد.","En":"Split the first factor into tens and ones."},{"Ar":"وزع الضرب في 7 على الجزأين ثم اجمع.","En":"Distribute multiplication by 7 across both parts, then add."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب 21 × 7.","En":"Compute 21 × 7."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج أكبر من مجموع حاصلَي الضرب بمقدار 1؛ تحقق من جمع الجزأين.","En":"This is 1 above the sum of the partial products; check the addition."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"148"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج أكبر من مجموع حاصلَي الضرب بمقدار 3؛ تحقق من جمع الجزأين.","En":"This is 3 above the sum of the partial products; check the addition."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"150"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج أصغر من مجموع حاصلَي الضرب بمقدار 2؛ تحقق من جمع الجزأين.","En":"This is 2 below the sum of the partial products; check the addition."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"145"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"147"}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب 21 × 7.","En":"Compute 21 × 7."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"خاصية التوزيع: نضرب العشرات والآحاد ثم نجمع.","En":"Distributive property: multiply the tens and ones, then add."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"فكّك 21 إلى 20 و1.","En":"Split 21 into 20 and 1."},{"Ar":"اضرب الجزأين في 7 فتحصل على 140 و7.","En":"Multiply both parts by 7 to obtain 140 and 7."},{"Ar":"اجمع حاصلَي الضرب: $140+7=147$.","En":"Add the partial products: $140+7=147$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$147$","En":"$147$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تهمل أحد جزأي العدد.","En":"Do not omit either part of the decomposed number."},"FormulaLatex":"(u+v)w=uw+vw","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(20+1)\\times7=140+7=147$","En":"$(20+1)\\times7=140+7=147$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$147\\div7=21$","En":"$147\\div7=21$"}},"TrackIds":[4],"CategoryId":33,"PrimarySkillId":4,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"جزّئ العامل الأول إلى عشرات وآحاد.","En":"Split the first factor into tens and ones."},{"Ar":"وزع الضرب في 7 على الجزأين ثم اجمع.","En":"Distribute multiplication by 7 across both parts, then add."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"خاصية التوزيع: نضرب العشرات والآحاد ثم نجمع.","En":"Distributive property: multiply the tens and ones, then add."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"فكّك 21 إلى 20 و1.","En":"Split 21 into 20 and 1."},{"Ar":"اضرب الجزأين في 7 فتحصل على 140 و7.","En":"Multiply both parts by 7 to obtain 140 and 7."},{"Ar":"اجمع حاصلَي الضرب: $140+7=147$.","En":"Add the partial products: $140+7=147$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$147$","En":"$147$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تهمل أحد جزأي العدد.","En":"Do not omit either part of the decomposed number."},"FormulaLatex":"(u+v)w=uw+vw","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(20+1)\\times7=140+7=147$","En":"$(20+1)\\times7=140+7=147$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$147\\div7=21$","En":"$147\\div7=21$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج أكبر من مجموع حاصلَي الضرب بمقدار 1؛ تحقق من جمع الجزأين.","En":"This is 1 above the sum of the partial products; check the addition."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج أكبر من مجموع حاصلَي الضرب بمقدار 3؛ تحقق من جمع الجزأين.","En":"This is 3 above the sum of the partial products; check the addition."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج أصغر من مجموع حاصلَي الضرب بمقدار 2؛ تحقق من جمع الجزأين.","En":"This is 2 below the sum of the partial products; check the addition."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$خاصية التوزيع: نضرب العشرات والآحاد ثم نجمع.

$(u+v)w=uw+vw$

1. فكّك 21 إلى 20 و1.

2. اضرب الجزأين في 7 فتحصل على 140 و7.

3. اجمع حاصلَي الضرب: $140+7=147$.

$(20+1)\times7=140+7=147$

$147$ بلا وحدة قياس

$147\div7=21$

لا تهمل أحد جزأي العدد.$mw$,$mw$Distributive property: multiply the tens and ones, then add.

$(u+v)w=uw+vw$

1. Split 21 into 20 and 1.

2. Multiply both parts by 7 to obtain 140 and 7.

3. Add the partial products: $140+7=147$.

$(20+1)\times7=140+7=147$

$147$ Dimensionless

$147\div7=21$

Do not omit either part of the decomposed number.$mw$),
(401,186,$mw$64684D9175678A5B9538A79DDC8F5FE9AE90CE32352A9314E8FC11DE9178A327$mw$,$mw$4fc19ab52e1a0ec859affd6c437fe808$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":186,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":33,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب 108 ÷ 6.","TitleEn":"Calculate 108 divided by 6.","QuestionTextAr":"احسب 108 ÷ 6.","QuestionTextEn":"Calculate 108 divided by 6.","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: نتحقق من القسمة بالضرب. لأن 6 × 18 = 108، فإن 108 ÷ 6 = 18. ولإظهار الحساب نفكك 108 إلى 60 + 48، ثم 60 ÷ 6 = 10 و48 ÷ 6 = 8؛ المجموع 18.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Multiplication checks division. Since 6 × 18 = 108, 108 ÷ 6 = 18. To compute it, split 108 = 60 + 48; then 60 ÷ 6 = 10 and 48 ÷ 6 = 8, totaling 18.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":733,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"21","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":734,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"16","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":735,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"18","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":736,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"19","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعن بحقيقة ضرب معكوسة.","En":"Use the inverse multiplication fact."},{"Ar":"ابحث عن العامل المجهول في 6 مضروباً في عدد يساوي 108.","En":"Find the missing factor in 6 times a number equaling 108."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب 108 ÷ 6.","En":"Calculate 108 divided by 6."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"اختبار هذا الخارج يعطي $21\\times6=126$ وليس 108.","En":"Checking this quotient gives $21\\times6=126$, not 108."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"21"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"اختبار هذا الخارج يعطي $16\\times6=96$ وليس 108.","En":"Checking this quotient gives $16\\times6=96$, not 108."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"16"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"18"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"اختبار هذا الخارج يعطي $19\\times6=114$ وليس 108.","En":"Checking this quotient gives $19\\times6=114$, not 108."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"19"}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب 108 ÷ 6.","En":"Calculate 108 divided by 6."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"القسمة هي العملية العكسية للضرب.","En":"Division is the inverse of multiplication."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"ابحث عن العامل المجهول في $6q=108$.","En":"Find the missing factor in $6q=108$."},{"Ar":"باستخدام الضرب: $6\\times18=108$، إذن $q=18$.","En":"Use multiplication: $6\\times18=108$, hence $q=18$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$18$","En":"$18$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تبدّل المقسوم والمقسوم عليه.","En":"Do not swap the dividend and divisor."},"FormulaLatex":"a\\div b=q\\iff bq=a\\quad(b\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$108\\div6=18$","En":"$108\\div6=18$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$18\\times6=108$","En":"$18\\times6=108$"}},"TrackIds":[4],"CategoryId":33,"PrimarySkillId":5,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعن بحقيقة ضرب معكوسة.","En":"Use the inverse multiplication fact."},{"Ar":"ابحث عن العامل المجهول في 6 مضروباً في عدد يساوي 108.","En":"Find the missing factor in 6 times a number equaling 108."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"القسمة هي العملية العكسية للضرب.","En":"Division is the inverse of multiplication."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"ابحث عن العامل المجهول في $6q=108$.","En":"Find the missing factor in $6q=108$."},{"Ar":"باستخدام الضرب: $6\\times18=108$، إذن $q=18$.","En":"Use multiplication: $6\\times18=108$, hence $q=18$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$18$","En":"$18$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تبدّل المقسوم والمقسوم عليه.","En":"Do not swap the dividend and divisor."},"FormulaLatex":"a\\div b=q\\iff bq=a\\quad(b\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$108\\div6=18$","En":"$108\\div6=18$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$18\\times6=108$","En":"$18\\times6=108$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"اختبار هذا الخارج يعطي $21\\times6=126$ وليس 108.","En":"Checking this quotient gives $21\\times6=126$, not 108."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"اختبار هذا الخارج يعطي $16\\times6=96$ وليس 108.","En":"Checking this quotient gives $16\\times6=96$, not 108."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"اختبار هذا الخارج يعطي $19\\times6=114$ وليس 108.","En":"Checking this quotient gives $19\\times6=114$, not 108."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$القسمة هي العملية العكسية للضرب.

$a\div b=q\iff bq=a\quad(b\ne0)$

1. ابحث عن العامل المجهول في $6q=108$.

2. باستخدام الضرب: $6\times18=108$، إذن $q=18$.

$108\div6=18$

$18$ بلا وحدة قياس

$18\times6=108$

لا تبدّل المقسوم والمقسوم عليه.$mw$,$mw$Division is the inverse of multiplication.

$a\div b=q\iff bq=a\quad(b\ne0)$

1. Find the missing factor in $6q=108$.

2. Use multiplication: $6\times18=108$, hence $q=18$.

$108\div6=18$

$18$ Dimensionless

$18\times6=108$

Do not swap the dividend and divisor.$mw$),
(402,187,$mw$090AFC29A9E791800BB2C9A2688AC570EC9FC52EE4CDEDB14D253A82F1851BA5$mw$,$mw$7a47892c5b9655a342691d4463804fc2$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":187,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":33,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ثمن القلم 10 وحدات. كم ثمن 7 أقلام؟","TitleEn":"Each pen costs 10 units. What do 7 pens cost?","QuestionTextAr":"ثمن القلم 10 وحدات. كم ثمن 7 أقلام؟","QuestionTextEn":"Each pen costs 10 units. What do 7 pens cost?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: السعر الكلي = السعر للوحدة × العدد. لدينا 7 أقلام وسعر كل قلم 10 وحدات. إذن الكلفة = 7 × 10 = 70 وحدة نقدية. الضرب بعشرة يضيف صفراً إلى العدد الصحيح 7.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Total price = unit price × quantity. Seven pens at 10 units each cost 7 × 10 = 70 units. Multiplying the whole number 7 by 10 gives 70.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":737,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"68","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":738,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"70","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":739,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"71","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":740,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"73","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"جميع الأقلام لها السعر نفسه.","En":"Each pen has the same price."},{"Ar":"استخدم الضرب لتكرار سعر القلم بعدد الأقلام.","En":"Use multiplication to repeat the unit price for the number of pens."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ثمن القلم 10 وحدات. كم ثمن 7 أقلام؟","En":"Each pen costs 10 units. What do 7 pens cost?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"المجموع ينقص بمقدار 2؛ يجب تكرار السعر كاملاً لكل قلم.","En":"This total is 2 too low; count the full price of each pen."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"68"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"70"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"المجموع يزيد بمقدار 1؛ يجب تكرار السعر كاملاً لكل قلم.","En":"This total is 1 too high; count the full price of each pen."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"71"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"المجموع يزيد بمقدار 3؛ يجب تكرار السعر كاملاً لكل قلم.","En":"This total is 3 too high; count the full price of each pen."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"73"}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"ثمن القلم 10 وحدات. كم ثمن 7 أقلام؟","En":"Each pen costs 10 units. What do 7 pens cost?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التكلفة الكلية تساوي سعر الوحدة مضروباً في الكمية.","En":"Total cost equals unit price times quantity."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وحدة نقدية","En":"currency units"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدد سعر القلم الواحد 10 وعدد الأقلام 7.","En":"Identify the unit price 10 and quantity 7."},{"Ar":"اضرب السعر في العدد: $10\\times7=70$.","En":"Multiply price by quantity: $10\\times7=70$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$70$","En":"$70$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"جمع السعر والكمية لا يعطي التكلفة.","En":"Adding price and quantity does not give total cost."},"FormulaLatex":"C=pq","Substitution":{"Ar":"$C=10\\times7=70$","En":"$C=10\\times7=70$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$70\\div7=10$","En":"$70\\div7=10$"}},"TrackIds":[3],"CategoryId":33,"PrimarySkillId":6,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"جميع الأقلام لها السعر نفسه.","En":"Each pen has the same price."},{"Ar":"استخدم الضرب لتكرار سعر القلم بعدد الأقلام.","En":"Use multiplication to repeat the unit price for the number of pens."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التكلفة الكلية تساوي سعر الوحدة مضروباً في الكمية.","En":"Total cost equals unit price times quantity."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وحدة نقدية","En":"currency units"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدد سعر القلم الواحد 10 وعدد الأقلام 7.","En":"Identify the unit price 10 and quantity 7."},{"Ar":"اضرب السعر في العدد: $10\\times7=70$.","En":"Multiply price by quantity: $10\\times7=70$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$70$","En":"$70$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"جمع السعر والكمية لا يعطي التكلفة.","En":"Adding price and quantity does not give total cost."},"FormulaLatex":"C=pq","Substitution":{"Ar":"$C=10\\times7=70$","En":"$C=10\\times7=70$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$70\\div7=10$","En":"$70\\div7=10$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"المجموع ينقص بمقدار 2؛ يجب تكرار السعر كاملاً لكل قلم.","En":"This total is 2 too low; count the full price of each pen."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"المجموع يزيد بمقدار 1؛ يجب تكرار السعر كاملاً لكل قلم.","En":"This total is 1 too high; count the full price of each pen."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"المجموع يزيد بمقدار 3؛ يجب تكرار السعر كاملاً لكل قلم.","En":"This total is 3 too high; count the full price of each pen."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$التكلفة الكلية تساوي سعر الوحدة مضروباً في الكمية.

$C=pq$

1. حدد سعر القلم الواحد 10 وعدد الأقلام 7.

2. اضرب السعر في العدد: $10\times7=70$.

$C=10\times7=70$

$70$ وحدة نقدية

$70\div7=10$

جمع السعر والكمية لا يعطي التكلفة.$mw$,$mw$Total cost equals unit price times quantity.

$C=pq$

1. Identify the unit price 10 and quantity 7.

2. Multiply price by quantity: $10\times7=70$.

$C=10\times7=70$

$70$ currency units

$70\div7=10$

Adding price and quantity does not give total cost.$mw$),
(405,191,$mw$8DEB2FBA23DD265B5848B7996B1D6FB1AC8DE9B051BC8AE82BEDC7D66D5FA7E2$mw$,$mw$43d4e7a6a9ae591ca46fdedfa7d7ae55$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":191,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":3,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما محيط مستطيل طوله 10 سم وعرضه 7 سم؟","TitleEn":"Find the perimeter of a 10 cm by 7 cm rectangle.","QuestionTextAr":"ما محيط مستطيل طوله 10 سم وعرضه 7 سم؟","QuestionTextEn":"Find the perimeter of a 10 cm by 7 cm rectangle.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: محيط المستطيل = 2 × (الطول + العرض)، لأن لكل بُعد ضلعين متساويين. المعطيات 10 سم و7 سم؛ نجمع 10 + 7 = 17 سم ثم نضاعف: 2 × 17 = 34 سم. المحيط طول الحدود الخارجية وليس مساحة.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Rectangle perimeter = 2 × (length + width), as each side length occurs twice. Given 10 cm and 7 cm, add 10 + 7 = 17 cm, then double: 2 × 17 = 34 cm. Perimeter measures distance around the shape.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":753,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"32","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":754,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"34","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":755,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"35","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":756,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"37","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"المحيط هو طول الحدود الخارجية.","En":"Perimeter measures the outside boundary."},{"Ar":"لكل من الطول والعرض ضلعان متساويان.","En":"There are two sides of each dimension."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما محيط مستطيل طوله 10 سم وعرضه 7 سم؟","En":"Find the perimeter of a 10 cm by 7 cm rectangle."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد ينقص عن مجموع الأضلاع الأربعة بمقدار 2 سم.","En":"This value is 2 cm below the sum of the four sides."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"32"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"34"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد يتجاوز مجموع الأضلاع الأربعة بمقدار 1 سم.","En":"This value is 1 cm above the sum of the four sides."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"35"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد يتجاوز مجموع الأضلاع الأربعة بمقدار 3 سم.","En":"This value is 3 cm above the sum of the four sides."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"37"}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"ما محيط مستطيل طوله 10 سم وعرضه 7 سم؟","En":"Find the perimeter of a 10 cm by 7 cm rectangle."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المحيط مجموع أطوال الأضلاع الأربعة.","En":"Perimeter is the sum of the four side lengths."},"Unit":{"Ar":"سم","En":"cm"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"اجمع الطول والعرض: $10+7=17$.","En":"Add length and width: $10+7=17$."},{"Ar":"ضاعف المجموع لأن لكل قياس ضلعين: $2\\times17=34$.","En":"Double the sum because each dimension occurs twice: $2\\times17=34$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$34$","En":"$34$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستخدم قانون المساحة لحساب المحيط.","En":"Do not use the area formula for perimeter."},"FormulaLatex":"P=2(l+w)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$P=2(10+7)=34$","En":"$P=2(10+7)=34$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$10+7+10+7=34$","En":"$10+7+10+7=34$"}},"TrackIds":[3],"CategoryId":3,"PrimarySkillId":12,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"المحيط هو طول الحدود الخارجية.","En":"Perimeter measures the outside boundary."},{"Ar":"لكل من الطول والعرض ضلعان متساويان.","En":"There are two sides of each dimension."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المحيط مجموع أطوال الأضلاع الأربعة.","En":"Perimeter is the sum of the four side lengths."},"Unit":{"Ar":"سم","En":"cm"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"اجمع الطول والعرض: $10+7=17$.","En":"Add length and width: $10+7=17$."},{"Ar":"ضاعف المجموع لأن لكل قياس ضلعين: $2\\times17=34$.","En":"Double the sum because each dimension occurs twice: $2\\times17=34$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$34$","En":"$34$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستخدم قانون المساحة لحساب المحيط.","En":"Do not use the area formula for perimeter."},"FormulaLatex":"P=2(l+w)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$P=2(10+7)=34$","En":"$P=2(10+7)=34$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$10+7+10+7=34$","En":"$10+7+10+7=34$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد ينقص عن مجموع الأضلاع الأربعة بمقدار 2 سم.","En":"This value is 2 cm below the sum of the four sides."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد يتجاوز مجموع الأضلاع الأربعة بمقدار 1 سم.","En":"This value is 1 cm above the sum of the four sides."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد يتجاوز مجموع الأضلاع الأربعة بمقدار 3 سم.","En":"This value is 3 cm above the sum of the four sides."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$المحيط مجموع أطوال الأضلاع الأربعة.

$P=2(l+w)$

1. اجمع الطول والعرض: $10+7=17$.

2. ضاعف المجموع لأن لكل قياس ضلعين: $2\times17=34$.

$P=2(10+7)=34$

$34$ سم

$10+7+10+7=34$

لا تستخدم قانون المساحة لحساب المحيط.$mw$,$mw$Perimeter is the sum of the four side lengths.

$P=2(l+w)$

1. Add length and width: $10+7=17$.

2. Double the sum because each dimension occurs twice: $2\times17=34$.

$P=2(10+7)=34$

$34$ cm

$10+7+10+7=34$

Do not use the area formula for perimeter.$mw$),
(409,196,$mw$80C221F8B3CDC411111B20973BCE3EE125331D8A709C0B1898EE101557AB153F$mw$,$mw$2b341787dbe4a827e6c65fa59a0ae8aa$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":196,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":4,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما وسيط القيم المرتبة 15، 18، 19، 22، 26؟","TitleEn":"What is the median of ordered values 15, 18, 19, 22, 26?","QuestionTextAr":"ما وسيط القيم المرتبة 15، 18، 19، 22، 26؟","QuestionTextEn":"What is the median of ordered values 15, 18, 19, 22, 26?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: الوسيط هو القيمة الوسطى بعد ترتيب البيانات تصاعدياً. القيم 15، 18، 19، 22، 26 مرتبة أصلاً وعددها 5، فتكون رتبة الوسط (5 + 1) ÷ 2 = 3. القيمة الثالثة هي 19، لذا الوسيط = 19.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: The median is the middle value after sorting the observations. The five values 15, 18, 19, 22, 26 are already ordered; the middle position is (5 + 1) ÷ 2 = 3. The third value is 19, so the median is 19.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":773,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"22","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":774,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"26","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":775,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"19","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":776,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"18","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"القائمة مرتبة بالفعل.","En":"The list is already ordered."},{"Ar":"حدد موقع الوسط من عدد عناصر القائمة.","En":"Find the middle position from the number of elements."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما وسيط القيم المرتبة 15، 18، 19، 22، 26؟","En":"What is the median of ordered values 15, 18, 19, 22, 26?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذه القيمة في الموضع 4، وليس الموضع الثالث.","En":"This value is in position 4, not the middle position."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"22"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذه القيمة في الموضع 5، وليس الموضع الثالث.","En":"This value is in position 5, not the middle position."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"26"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"19"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذه القيمة في الموضع 2، وليس الموضع الثالث.","En":"This value is in position 2, not the middle position."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"18"}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"ما وسيط القيم المرتبة 15، 18، 19، 22، 26؟","En":"What is the median of ordered values 15, 18, 19, 22, 26?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الوسيط في قائمة مرتبة فردية العدد هو القيمة الوسطى.","En":"For an odd-sized sorted list, the median is the middle value."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عدد القيم 5 فردي، فالموضع الأوسط $(5+1)/2=3$.","En":"There are 5 values; the middle position is $(5+1)/2=3$."},{"Ar":"اقرأ القيمة الثالثة في القائمة المرتبة: 19.","En":"Read the third value in the ordered list: 19."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$19$","En":"$19$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط بين الوسيط والمتوسط الحسابي.","En":"Do not confuse the median with the arithmetic mean."},"FormulaLatex":"\\operatorname{median}(X)=x_{(n+1)/2}\\quad(n\\text{ odd})","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{5+1}{2}=3$","En":"$\\frac{5+1}{2}=3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"قبل 19 قيمتان وبعدها قيمتان.","En":"Two values precede 19 and two follow it."}},"TrackIds":[5],"CategoryId":4,"PrimarySkillId":18,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"القائمة مرتبة بالفعل.","En":"The list is already ordered."},{"Ar":"حدد موقع الوسط من عدد عناصر القائمة.","En":"Find the middle position from the number of elements."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الوسيط في قائمة مرتبة فردية العدد هو القيمة الوسطى.","En":"For an odd-sized sorted list, the median is the middle value."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عدد القيم 5 فردي، فالموضع الأوسط $(5+1)/2=3$.","En":"There are 5 values; the middle position is $(5+1)/2=3$."},{"Ar":"اقرأ القيمة الثالثة في القائمة المرتبة: 19.","En":"Read the third value in the ordered list: 19."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$19$","En":"$19$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط بين الوسيط والمتوسط الحسابي.","En":"Do not confuse the median with the arithmetic mean."},"FormulaLatex":"\\operatorname{median}(X)=x_{(n+1)/2}\\quad(n\\text{ odd})","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{5+1}{2}=3$","En":"$\\frac{5+1}{2}=3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"قبل 19 قيمتان وبعدها قيمتان.","En":"Two values precede 19 and two follow it."}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذه القيمة في الموضع 4، وليس الموضع الثالث.","En":"This value is in position 4, not the middle position."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذه القيمة في الموضع 5، وليس الموضع الثالث.","En":"This value is in position 5, not the middle position."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذه القيمة في الموضع 2، وليس الموضع الثالث.","En":"This value is in position 2, not the middle position."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الوسيط في قائمة مرتبة فردية العدد هو القيمة الوسطى.

$\operatorname{median}(X)=x_{(n+1)/2}\quad(n\text{ odd})$

1. عدد القيم 5 فردي، فالموضع الأوسط $(5+1)/2=3$.

2. اقرأ القيمة الثالثة في القائمة المرتبة: 19.

$\frac{5+1}{2}=3$

$19$ بلا وحدة قياس

قبل 19 قيمتان وبعدها قيمتان.

لا تخلط بين الوسيط والمتوسط الحسابي.$mw$,$mw$For an odd-sized sorted list, the median is the middle value.

$\operatorname{median}(X)=x_{(n+1)/2}\quad(n\text{ odd})$

1. There are 5 values; the middle position is $(5+1)/2=3$.

2. Read the third value in the ordered list: 19.

$\frac{5+1}{2}=3$

$19$ Dimensionless

Two values precede 19 and two follow it.

Do not confuse the median with the arithmetic mean.$mw$),
(410,197,$mw$AA5D2F9C96BFBC9D5B49DF8C59621DDB533C3CE2D678526E1F962CE7473B3C15$mw$,$mw$b76f86f40c7af3432a205f5686e3e59f$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":197,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":33,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب 24 × 8.","TitleEn":"Compute 24 × 8.","QuestionTextAr":"احسب 24 × 8.","QuestionTextEn":"Compute 24 × 8.","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: توزيع الضرب على العشرات والآحاد. نفكك 24 = 20 + 4، فنحسب 24 × 8 = 20 × 8 + 4 × 8 = 160 + 32 = 192. إذن الناتج 192.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Distribute multiplication over tens and ones. Split 24 into 20 + 4: 24 × 8 = (20 × 8) + (4 × 8) = 160 + 32 = 192. Answer: 192.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":777,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"195","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":778,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"190","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":779,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"192","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":780,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"193","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"جزّئ العامل الأول إلى عشرات وآحاد.","En":"Split the first factor into tens and ones."},{"Ar":"وزع الضرب في 8 على الجزأين ثم اجمع.","En":"Distribute multiplication by 8 across both parts, then add."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب 24 × 8.","En":"Compute 24 × 8."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج أكبر من مجموع حاصلَي الضرب بمقدار 3؛ تحقق من جمع الجزأين.","En":"This is 3 above the sum of the partial products; check the addition."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"195"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج أصغر من مجموع حاصلَي الضرب بمقدار 2؛ تحقق من جمع الجزأين.","En":"This is 2 below the sum of the partial products; check the addition."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"190"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"192"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج أكبر من مجموع حاصلَي الضرب بمقدار 1؛ تحقق من جمع الجزأين.","En":"This is 1 above the sum of the partial products; check the addition."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"193"}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب 24 × 8.","En":"Compute 24 × 8."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"خاصية التوزيع: نضرب العشرات والآحاد ثم نجمع.","En":"Distributive property: multiply the tens and ones, then add."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"فكّك 24 إلى 20 و4.","En":"Split 24 into 20 and 4."},{"Ar":"اضرب الجزأين في 8 فتحصل على 160 و32.","En":"Multiply both parts by 8 to obtain 160 and 32."},{"Ar":"اجمع حاصلَي الضرب: $160+32=192$.","En":"Add the partial products: $160+32=192$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$192$","En":"$192$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تهمل أحد جزأي العدد.","En":"Do not omit either part of the decomposed number."},"FormulaLatex":"(u+v)w=uw+vw","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(20+4)\\times8=160+32=192$","En":"$(20+4)\\times8=160+32=192$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$192\\div8=24$","En":"$192\\div8=24$"}},"TrackIds":[4],"CategoryId":33,"PrimarySkillId":4,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"جزّئ العامل الأول إلى عشرات وآحاد.","En":"Split the first factor into tens and ones."},{"Ar":"وزع الضرب في 8 على الجزأين ثم اجمع.","En":"Distribute multiplication by 8 across both parts, then add."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"خاصية التوزيع: نضرب العشرات والآحاد ثم نجمع.","En":"Distributive property: multiply the tens and ones, then add."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"فكّك 24 إلى 20 و4.","En":"Split 24 into 20 and 4."},{"Ar":"اضرب الجزأين في 8 فتحصل على 160 و32.","En":"Multiply both parts by 8 to obtain 160 and 32."},{"Ar":"اجمع حاصلَي الضرب: $160+32=192$.","En":"Add the partial products: $160+32=192$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$192$","En":"$192$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تهمل أحد جزأي العدد.","En":"Do not omit either part of the decomposed number."},"FormulaLatex":"(u+v)w=uw+vw","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(20+4)\\times8=160+32=192$","En":"$(20+4)\\times8=160+32=192$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$192\\div8=24$","En":"$192\\div8=24$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج أكبر من مجموع حاصلَي الضرب بمقدار 3؛ تحقق من جمع الجزأين.","En":"This is 3 above the sum of the partial products; check the addition."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج أصغر من مجموع حاصلَي الضرب بمقدار 2؛ تحقق من جمع الجزأين.","En":"This is 2 below the sum of the partial products; check the addition."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج أكبر من مجموع حاصلَي الضرب بمقدار 1؛ تحقق من جمع الجزأين.","En":"This is 1 above the sum of the partial products; check the addition."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$خاصية التوزيع: نضرب العشرات والآحاد ثم نجمع.

$(u+v)w=uw+vw$

1. فكّك 24 إلى 20 و4.

2. اضرب الجزأين في 8 فتحصل على 160 و32.

3. اجمع حاصلَي الضرب: $160+32=192$.

$(20+4)\times8=160+32=192$

$192$ بلا وحدة قياس

$192\div8=24$

لا تهمل أحد جزأي العدد.$mw$,$mw$Distributive property: multiply the tens and ones, then add.

$(u+v)w=uw+vw$

1. Split 24 into 20 and 4.

2. Multiply both parts by 8 to obtain 160 and 32.

3. Add the partial products: $160+32=192$.

$(20+4)\times8=160+32=192$

$192$ Dimensionless

$192\div8=24$

Do not omit either part of the decomposed number.$mw$),
(411,198,$mw$C3FFBBFE84D8BAE7B9CFB0557CC0CABFD00BA1F3B7163FB7426A6A255DE6418A$mw$,$mw$15da7d6cce0ff178240d2fb1d7ee54ae$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":198,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":33,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب 140 ÷ 7.","TitleEn":"Calculate 140 divided by 7.","QuestionTextAr":"احسب 140 ÷ 7.","QuestionTextEn":"Calculate 140 divided by 7.","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: القسمة عكس الضرب. نبحث عن عدد إذا ضربناه في 7 أعطى 140. نلاحظ أن 7 × 2 = 14، وبالتالي 7 × 20 = 140. إذن 140 ÷ 7 = 20.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Division is the inverse of multiplication. Find the number that multiplied by 7 gives 140. Since 7 × 2 = 14, it follows that 7 × 20 = 140. Therefore 140 ÷ 7 = 20.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":781,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"18","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":782,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"20","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":783,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"21","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":784,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"23","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعن بحقيقة ضرب معكوسة.","En":"Use the inverse multiplication fact."},{"Ar":"ابحث عن العامل المجهول في 7 مضروباً في عدد يساوي 140.","En":"Find the missing factor in 7 times a number equaling 140."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب 140 ÷ 7.","En":"Calculate 140 divided by 7."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"اختبار هذا الخارج يعطي $18\\times7=126$ وليس 140.","En":"Checking this quotient gives $18\\times7=126$, not 140."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"18"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"20"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"اختبار هذا الخارج يعطي $21\\times7=147$ وليس 140.","En":"Checking this quotient gives $21\\times7=147$, not 140."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"21"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"اختبار هذا الخارج يعطي $23\\times7=161$ وليس 140.","En":"Checking this quotient gives $23\\times7=161$, not 140."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"23"}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب 140 ÷ 7.","En":"Calculate 140 divided by 7."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"القسمة هي العملية العكسية للضرب.","En":"Division is the inverse of multiplication."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"ابحث عن العامل المجهول في $7q=140$.","En":"Find the missing factor in $7q=140$."},{"Ar":"باستخدام الضرب: $7\\times20=140$، إذن $q=20$.","En":"Use multiplication: $7\\times20=140$, hence $q=20$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$20$","En":"$20$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تبدّل المقسوم والمقسوم عليه.","En":"Do not swap the dividend and divisor."},"FormulaLatex":"a\\div b=q\\iff bq=a\\quad(b\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$140\\div7=20$","En":"$140\\div7=20$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$20\\times7=140$","En":"$20\\times7=140$"}},"TrackIds":[4],"CategoryId":33,"PrimarySkillId":5,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعن بحقيقة ضرب معكوسة.","En":"Use the inverse multiplication fact."},{"Ar":"ابحث عن العامل المجهول في 7 مضروباً في عدد يساوي 140.","En":"Find the missing factor in 7 times a number equaling 140."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"القسمة هي العملية العكسية للضرب.","En":"Division is the inverse of multiplication."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"ابحث عن العامل المجهول في $7q=140$.","En":"Find the missing factor in $7q=140$."},{"Ar":"باستخدام الضرب: $7\\times20=140$، إذن $q=20$.","En":"Use multiplication: $7\\times20=140$, hence $q=20$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$20$","En":"$20$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تبدّل المقسوم والمقسوم عليه.","En":"Do not swap the dividend and divisor."},"FormulaLatex":"a\\div b=q\\iff bq=a\\quad(b\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$140\\div7=20$","En":"$140\\div7=20$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$20\\times7=140$","En":"$20\\times7=140$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"اختبار هذا الخارج يعطي $18\\times7=126$ وليس 140.","En":"Checking this quotient gives $18\\times7=126$, not 140."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"اختبار هذا الخارج يعطي $21\\times7=147$ وليس 140.","En":"Checking this quotient gives $21\\times7=147$, not 140."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"اختبار هذا الخارج يعطي $23\\times7=161$ وليس 140.","En":"Checking this quotient gives $23\\times7=161$, not 140."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$القسمة هي العملية العكسية للضرب.

$a\div b=q\iff bq=a\quad(b\ne0)$

1. ابحث عن العامل المجهول في $7q=140$.

2. باستخدام الضرب: $7\times20=140$، إذن $q=20$.

$140\div7=20$

$20$ بلا وحدة قياس

$20\times7=140$

لا تبدّل المقسوم والمقسوم عليه.$mw$,$mw$Division is the inverse of multiplication.

$a\div b=q\iff bq=a\quad(b\ne0)$

1. Find the missing factor in $7q=140$.

2. Use multiplication: $7\times20=140$, hence $q=20$.

$140\div7=20$

$20$ Dimensionless

$20\times7=140$

Do not swap the dividend and divisor.$mw$),
(419,208,$mw$D84B2D6FA44359E80F2C650B1298E145146AE83B59347E671860A9599FD655E4$mw$,$mw$79967084df1e605fa66460bd5eb04ecb$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":208,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":4,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما وسيط القيم المرتبة 18، 21، 22، 25، 29؟","TitleEn":"What is the median of ordered values 18, 21, 22, 25, 29?","QuestionTextAr":"ما وسيط القيم المرتبة 18، 21، 22، 25، 29؟","QuestionTextEn":"What is the median of ordered values 18, 21, 22, 25, 29?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: الوسيط هو القيمة الوسطى بعد ترتيب البيانات تصاعدياً. القيم 18، 21، 22، 25، 29 مرتبة أصلاً وعددها 5، فتكون رتبة الوسط (5 + 1) ÷ 2 = 3. القيمة الثالثة هي 22، لذا الوسيط = 22.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: The median is the middle value after sorting the observations. The five values 18, 21, 22, 25, 29 are already ordered; the middle position is (5 + 1) ÷ 2 = 3. The third value is 22, so the median is 22.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":821,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"29","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":822,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"22","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":823,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"21","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":824,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"25","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"القائمة مرتبة بالفعل.","En":"The list is already ordered."},{"Ar":"حدد موقع الوسط من عدد عناصر القائمة.","En":"Find the middle position from the number of elements."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما وسيط القيم المرتبة 18، 21، 22، 25، 29؟","En":"What is the median of ordered values 18, 21, 22, 25, 29?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذه القيمة في الموضع 5، وليس الموضع الثالث.","En":"This value is in position 5, not the middle position."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"29"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"22"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذه القيمة في الموضع 2، وليس الموضع الثالث.","En":"This value is in position 2, not the middle position."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"21"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذه القيمة في الموضع 4، وليس الموضع الثالث.","En":"This value is in position 4, not the middle position."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"25"}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"ما وسيط القيم المرتبة 18، 21، 22، 25، 29؟","En":"What is the median of ordered values 18, 21, 22, 25, 29?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الوسيط في قائمة مرتبة فردية العدد هو القيمة الوسطى.","En":"For an odd-sized sorted list, the median is the middle value."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عدد القيم 5 فردي، فالموضع الأوسط $(5+1)/2=3$.","En":"There are 5 values; the middle position is $(5+1)/2=3$."},{"Ar":"اقرأ القيمة الثالثة في القائمة المرتبة: 22.","En":"Read the third value in the ordered list: 22."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$22$","En":"$22$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط بين الوسيط والمتوسط الحسابي.","En":"Do not confuse the median with the arithmetic mean."},"FormulaLatex":"\\operatorname{median}(X)=x_{(n+1)/2}\\quad(n\\text{ odd})","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{5+1}{2}=3$","En":"$\\frac{5+1}{2}=3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"قبل 22 قيمتان وبعدها قيمتان.","En":"Two values precede 22 and two follow it."}},"TrackIds":[5],"CategoryId":4,"PrimarySkillId":18,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"القائمة مرتبة بالفعل.","En":"The list is already ordered."},{"Ar":"حدد موقع الوسط من عدد عناصر القائمة.","En":"Find the middle position from the number of elements."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الوسيط في قائمة مرتبة فردية العدد هو القيمة الوسطى.","En":"For an odd-sized sorted list, the median is the middle value."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عدد القيم 5 فردي، فالموضع الأوسط $(5+1)/2=3$.","En":"There are 5 values; the middle position is $(5+1)/2=3$."},{"Ar":"اقرأ القيمة الثالثة في القائمة المرتبة: 22.","En":"Read the third value in the ordered list: 22."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$22$","En":"$22$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط بين الوسيط والمتوسط الحسابي.","En":"Do not confuse the median with the arithmetic mean."},"FormulaLatex":"\\operatorname{median}(X)=x_{(n+1)/2}\\quad(n\\text{ odd})","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{5+1}{2}=3$","En":"$\\frac{5+1}{2}=3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"قبل 22 قيمتان وبعدها قيمتان.","En":"Two values precede 22 and two follow it."}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذه القيمة في الموضع 5، وليس الموضع الثالث.","En":"This value is in position 5, not the middle position."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذه القيمة في الموضع 2، وليس الموضع الثالث.","En":"This value is in position 2, not the middle position."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذه القيمة في الموضع 4، وليس الموضع الثالث.","En":"This value is in position 4, not the middle position."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الوسيط في قائمة مرتبة فردية العدد هو القيمة الوسطى.

$\operatorname{median}(X)=x_{(n+1)/2}\quad(n\text{ odd})$

1. عدد القيم 5 فردي، فالموضع الأوسط $(5+1)/2=3$.

2. اقرأ القيمة الثالثة في القائمة المرتبة: 22.

$\frac{5+1}{2}=3$

$22$ بلا وحدة قياس

قبل 22 قيمتان وبعدها قيمتان.

لا تخلط بين الوسيط والمتوسط الحسابي.$mw$,$mw$For an odd-sized sorted list, the median is the middle value.

$\operatorname{median}(X)=x_{(n+1)/2}\quad(n\text{ odd})$

1. There are 5 values; the middle position is $(5+1)/2=3$.

2. Read the third value in the ordered list: 22.

$\frac{5+1}{2}=3$

$22$ Dimensionless

Two values precede 22 and two follow it.

Do not confuse the median with the arithmetic mean.$mw$),
(420,209,$mw$73AA1AB0ABB583A35F46560F02211631B2F69F614113302E9202EEA0EBFDE379$mw$,$mw$5c4e860b730e4bc46e40e564199977b3$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":209,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":5,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"أوجد القاسم المشترك الأكبر لـ6 و10.","TitleEn":"Find gcd(6,10).","QuestionTextAr":"أوجد القاسم المشترك الأكبر لـ6 و10.","QuestionTextEn":"Find gcd(6,10).","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: القاسم المشترك الأكبر للعددين (3 × 2) و(5 × 2) هو 2 لأن 3 و5 لا قاسم مشترك بينهما غير 1. نكتب 6 = 3 × 2 و10 = 5 × 2. الجزء المشترك الأكبر هو 2، ولذلك gcd(6, 10) = 2.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: If two numbers are 3 × 2 and 5 × 2, then gcd = 2 because 3 and 5 are coprime. Factor 6 = 3 × 2 and 10 = 5 × 2; the largest shared factor is 2. Thus gcd(6, 10) = 2.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":825,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":826,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":827,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":828,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"3","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابحث عن قواسم العددين المشتركة.","En":"Look for divisors shared by both numbers."},{"Ar":"جرّب قسمة الأكبر على الأصغر وتابع باستخدام الباقي.","En":"Divide the larger by the smaller and continue with the remainder."}],"Title":{"Ar":"أوجد القاسم المشترك الأكبر لـ6 و10.","En":"Find gcd(6,10)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"باقيا القسمة على 5 هما 1 و0؛ ليسا صفرين معاً.","En":"The remainders on division by 5 are 1 and 0; both are not zero."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"5"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الصفر ليس قاسماً موجباً ولا تجوز القسمة عليه.","En":"Zero is not a positive divisor; division by zero is undefined."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"0"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"2"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"باقيا القسمة على 3 هما 0 و1؛ ليسا صفرين معاً.","En":"The remainders on division by 3 are 0 and 1; both are not zero."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"3"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"أوجد القاسم المشترك الأكبر لـ6 و10.","En":"Find gcd(6,10)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"القاسم المشترك الأكبر هو أكبر عدد موجب يقسم العددين دون باقٍ؛ نستعمل خوارزمية إقليدس.","En":"The greatest common divisor is the largest positive divisor of both numbers; use Euclid's algorithm."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نفّذ القسمة مع الباقي: $10=1\\times6+4$.","En":"Divide with remainder: $10=1\\times6+4$."},{"Ar":"نفّذ القسمة مع الباقي: $6=1\\times4+2$.","En":"Divide with remainder: $6=1\\times4+2$."},{"Ar":"نفّذ القسمة مع الباقي: $4=2\\times2+0$.","En":"Divide with remainder: $4=2\\times2+0$."},{"Ar":"آخر مقسوم عليه غير صفري هو 2.","En":"The last nonzero divisor is 2."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$2$","En":"$2$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"القاسم المشترك ليس بالضرورة أكبر العددين أو أحدهما.","En":"The GCD is not necessarily the larger number or one of the given numbers."},"FormulaLatex":"\\gcd(a,b)=\\gcd(b,a\\bmod b)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$10=1\\times6+4,\\quad 6=1\\times4+2,\\quad 4=2\\times2+0$","En":"$10=1\\times6+4,\\quad 6=1\\times4+2,\\quad 4=2\\times2+0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$6\\div2=3,\\quad 10\\div2=5$","En":"$6\\div2=3,\\quad 10\\div2=5$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":5,"PrimarySkillId":22,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابحث عن قواسم العددين المشتركة.","En":"Look for divisors shared by both numbers."},{"Ar":"جرّب قسمة الأكبر على الأصغر وتابع باستخدام الباقي.","En":"Divide the larger by the smaller and continue with the remainder."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"القاسم المشترك الأكبر هو أكبر عدد موجب يقسم العددين دون باقٍ؛ نستعمل خوارزمية إقليدس.","En":"The greatest common divisor is the largest positive divisor of both numbers; use Euclid's algorithm."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نفّذ القسمة مع الباقي: $10=1\\times6+4$.","En":"Divide with remainder: $10=1\\times6+4$."},{"Ar":"نفّذ القسمة مع الباقي: $6=1\\times4+2$.","En":"Divide with remainder: $6=1\\times4+2$."},{"Ar":"نفّذ القسمة مع الباقي: $4=2\\times2+0$.","En":"Divide with remainder: $4=2\\times2+0$."},{"Ar":"آخر مقسوم عليه غير صفري هو 2.","En":"The last nonzero divisor is 2."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$2$","En":"$2$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"القاسم المشترك ليس بالضرورة أكبر العددين أو أحدهما.","En":"The GCD is not necessarily the larger number or one of the given numbers."},"FormulaLatex":"\\gcd(a,b)=\\gcd(b,a\\bmod b)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$10=1\\times6+4,\\quad 6=1\\times4+2,\\quad 4=2\\times2+0$","En":"$10=1\\times6+4,\\quad 6=1\\times4+2,\\quad 4=2\\times2+0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$6\\div2=3,\\quad 10\\div2=5$","En":"$6\\div2=3,\\quad 10\\div2=5$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"باقيا القسمة على 5 هما 1 و0؛ ليسا صفرين معاً.","En":"The remainders on division by 5 are 1 and 0; both are not zero."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"الصفر ليس قاسماً موجباً ولا تجوز القسمة عليه.","En":"Zero is not a positive divisor; division by zero is undefined."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"باقيا القسمة على 3 هما 0 و1؛ ليسا صفرين معاً.","En":"The remainders on division by 3 are 0 and 1; both are not zero."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$القاسم المشترك الأكبر هو أكبر عدد موجب يقسم العددين دون باقٍ؛ نستعمل خوارزمية إقليدس.

$\gcd(a,b)=\gcd(b,a\bmod b)$

1. نفّذ القسمة مع الباقي: $10=1\times6+4$.

2. نفّذ القسمة مع الباقي: $6=1\times4+2$.

3. نفّذ القسمة مع الباقي: $4=2\times2+0$.

4. آخر مقسوم عليه غير صفري هو 2.

$10=1\times6+4,\quad 6=1\times4+2,\quad 4=2\times2+0$

$2$ بلا وحدة قياس

$6\div2=3,\quad 10\div2=5$

القاسم المشترك ليس بالضرورة أكبر العددين أو أحدهما.$mw$,$mw$The greatest common divisor is the largest positive divisor of both numbers; use Euclid's algorithm.

$\gcd(a,b)=\gcd(b,a\bmod b)$

1. Divide with remainder: $10=1\times6+4$.

2. Divide with remainder: $6=1\times4+2$.

3. Divide with remainder: $4=2\times2+0$.

4. The last nonzero divisor is 2.

$10=1\times6+4,\quad 6=1\times4+2,\quad 4=2\times2+0$

$2$ Dimensionless

$6\div2=3,\quad 10\div2=5$

The GCD is not necessarily the larger number or one of the given numbers.$mw$),
(421,210,$mw$20A2B0D3F17D19D0021FB881EE1A9ECE1602B8C5BFBCCCBE3C3EF4E62517DB8B$mw$,$mw$42f190484a9e44c77d27588527fef3da$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":210,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":5,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"بسّط \\(\\frac{2^{5}}{2^{3}}\\).","TitleEn":"Simplify \\(\\frac{2^{5}}{2^{3}}\\).","QuestionTextAr":"بسّط \\(\\frac{2^{5}}{2^{3}}\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Simplify \\(\\frac{2^{5}}{2^{3}}\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون قسمة الأسس المتشابهة: أ^ن ÷ أ^م = أ^(ن − م) عندما يكون أ غير صفري. هنا الأساس 2 نفسه في البسط والمقام، لذلك 2^5 ÷ 2^3 = 2^(5 − 3) = 2^2. نحافظ على صورة القوة لأن المطلوب تبسيط العبارة الأسية.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Quotient law of exponents: a^n ÷ a^m = a^(n−m) for nonzero a. Both numerator and denominator use base 2, so 2^5 ÷ 2^3 = 2^(5 − 3) = 2^2. The simplified result remains in exponent form.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":829,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"2^{4}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":830,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"2^{2}","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":831,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"2^{1}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":832,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"2^{3}","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"الأساس مشترك وغير صفري.","En":"The common base is nonzero."},{"Ar":"اطرح أس المقام من أس البسط.","En":"Subtract the denominator exponent from the numerator exponent."}],"Title":{"Ar":"بسّط \\(\\frac{2^{5}}{2^{3}}\\).","En":"Simplify \\(\\frac{2^{5}}{2^{3}}\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الأس لا يساوي فرق الأسين؛ ضرب الخيار في المقام لا يعيد البسط.","En":"The exponent is not the difference; multiplying by the denominator does not recover the numerator."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"2^{4}"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"2^{2}"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الأس لا يساوي فرق الأسين؛ ضرب الخيار في المقام لا يعيد البسط.","En":"The exponent is not the difference; multiplying by the denominator does not recover the numerator."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"2^{1}"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الأس لا يساوي فرق الأسين؛ ضرب الخيار في المقام لا يعيد البسط.","En":"The exponent is not the difference; multiplying by the denominator does not recover the numerator."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"2^{3}"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"بسّط \\(\\frac{2^{5}}{2^{3}}\\).","En":"Simplify \\(\\frac{2^{5}}{2^{3}}\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"عند قسمة قوتين لهما الأساس نفسه نطرح الأسس.","En":"When dividing powers of the same nonzero base, subtract the exponents."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الأساسان متساويان وغير صفريين: 2.","En":"Both bases equal the nonzero value 2."},{"Ar":"اطرح أس المقام من أس البسط: $5-3=2$، واحتفظ بالأساس.","En":"Subtract the denominator exponent: $5-3=2$, retaining the base."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$2^{2}$","En":"$2^{2}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تغير الأساس أو تستعمل العملية على الأسس دون مراعاة نوعها.","En":"Do not change the base or use an exponent operation unrelated to the original operation."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{a^m}{a^n}=a^{m-n}\\quad(a\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{2^{5}}{2^{3}}=2^{5-3}=2^{2}$","En":"$\\frac{2^{5}}{2^{3}}=2^{5-3}=2^{2}$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$2^{2}\\times2^{3}=2^{5}$","En":"$2^{2}\\times2^{3}=2^{5}$"}},"TrackIds":[8],"CategoryId":5,"PrimarySkillId":21,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"الأساس مشترك وغير صفري.","En":"The common base is nonzero."},{"Ar":"اطرح أس المقام من أس البسط.","En":"Subtract the denominator exponent from the numerator exponent."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"عند قسمة قوتين لهما الأساس نفسه نطرح الأسس.","En":"When dividing powers of the same nonzero base, subtract the exponents."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الأساسان متساويان وغير صفريين: 2.","En":"Both bases equal the nonzero value 2."},{"Ar":"اطرح أس المقام من أس البسط: $5-3=2$، واحتفظ بالأساس.","En":"Subtract the denominator exponent: $5-3=2$, retaining the base."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$2^{2}$","En":"$2^{2}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تغير الأساس أو تستعمل العملية على الأسس دون مراعاة نوعها.","En":"Do not change the base or use an exponent operation unrelated to the original operation."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{a^m}{a^n}=a^{m-n}\\quad(a\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{2^{5}}{2^{3}}=2^{5-3}=2^{2}$","En":"$\\frac{2^{5}}{2^{3}}=2^{5-3}=2^{2}$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$2^{2}\\times2^{3}=2^{5}$","En":"$2^{2}\\times2^{3}=2^{5}$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الأس لا يساوي فرق الأسين؛ ضرب الخيار في المقام لا يعيد البسط.","En":"The exponent is not the difference; multiplying by the denominator does not recover the numerator."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الأس لا يساوي فرق الأسين؛ ضرب الخيار في المقام لا يعيد البسط.","En":"The exponent is not the difference; multiplying by the denominator does not recover the numerator."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الأس لا يساوي فرق الأسين؛ ضرب الخيار في المقام لا يعيد البسط.","En":"The exponent is not the difference; multiplying by the denominator does not recover the numerator."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$عند قسمة قوتين لهما الأساس نفسه نطرح الأسس.

$\frac{a^m}{a^n}=a^{m-n}\quad(a\ne0)$

1. الأساسان متساويان وغير صفريين: 2.

2. اطرح أس المقام من أس البسط: $5-3=2$، واحتفظ بالأساس.

$\frac{2^{5}}{2^{3}}=2^{5-3}=2^{2}$

$2^{2}$ بلا وحدة قياس

$2^{2}\times2^{3}=2^{5}$

لا تغير الأساس أو تستعمل العملية على الأسس دون مراعاة نوعها.$mw$,$mw$When dividing powers of the same nonzero base, subtract the exponents.

$\frac{a^m}{a^n}=a^{m-n}\quad(a\ne0)$

1. Both bases equal the nonzero value 2.

2. Subtract the denominator exponent: $5-3=2$, retaining the base.

$\frac{2^{5}}{2^{3}}=2^{5-3}=2^{2}$

$2^{2}$ Dimensionless

$2^{2}\times2^{3}=2^{5}$

Do not change the base or use an exponent operation unrelated to the original operation.$mw$),
(422,211,$mw$CF63F5D447A33909FC6ABCE9FB4029F7D00FDDEA310466C895D34F719E606473$mw$,$mw$00c773394c64b5e2c1a2a91fb9c9f27e$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":211,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":5,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"أوجد المضاعف المشترك الأصغر للعددين 8 و10.","TitleEn":"Find the least common multiple of 8 and 10.","QuestionTextAr":"أوجد المضاعف المشترك الأصغر للعددين 8 و10.","QuestionTextEn":"Find the least common multiple of 8 and 10.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: المضاعف المشترك الأصغر للعددين = حاصل ضربهما ÷ القاسم المشترك الأكبر لهما. العددان 8 و10، والقاسم المشترك الأكبر = 2، لأنهما 2 × 4 و2 × 5. بالتعويض: LCM = (8 × 10) ÷ 2 = 40. هذا أصغر عدد موجب يقبل القسمة على العددين.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Least common multiple = product of the numbers ÷ their greatest common divisor. For 8 and 10, the GCD is 2, because the numbers are 2×4 and 2×5. Therefore LCM = (8 × 10) ÷ 2 = 40, the smallest positive multiple shared by both.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":833,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"40","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":834,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"41","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":835,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"43","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":836,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"38","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابحث عن عدد موجب يقبل القسمة على العددين.","En":"Find a positive number divisible by both numbers."},{"Ar":"اكتب مضاعفات العددين حتى تجد أول مضاعف مشترك.","En":"List multiples of both numbers until the first common one appears."}],"Title":{"Ar":"أوجد المضاعف المشترك الأصغر للعددين 8 و10.","En":"Find the least common multiple of 8 and 10."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"40"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"باقيا قسمته على 8 و10 هما 1 و1؛ ليس مضاعفاً مشتركاً.","En":"Its remainders on division by 8 and 10 are 1 and 1; it is not a common multiple."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"41"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"باقيا قسمته على 8 و10 هما 3 و3؛ ليس مضاعفاً مشتركاً.","En":"Its remainders on division by 8 and 10 are 3 and 3; it is not a common multiple."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"43"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"باقيا قسمته على 8 و10 هما 6 و8؛ ليس مضاعفاً مشتركاً.","En":"Its remainders on division by 8 and 10 are 6 and 8; it is not a common multiple."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"38"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"أوجد المضاعف المشترك الأصغر للعددين 8 و10.","En":"Find the least common multiple of 8 and 10."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المضاعف المشترك الأصغر هو أصغر مضاعف موجب للعددين.","En":"The least common multiple is the smallest positive multiple of both numbers."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"القاسم المشترك الأكبر للعددين هو 2.","En":"The greatest common divisor is 2."},{"Ar":"اقسم حاصل الضرب على القاسم: $\\frac{8\\times10}{2}=40$.","En":"Divide the product by the GCD: $\\frac{8\\times10}{2}=40$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$40$","En":"$40$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط المضاعف المشترك بالقاسم المشترك.","En":"Do not confuse the common multiple with the common divisor."},"FormulaLatex":"\\operatorname{lcm}(a,b)=\\frac{|ab|}{\\gcd(a,b)}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{8\\times10}{2}=40$","En":"$\\frac{8\\times10}{2}=40$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$40\\div8=5,\\quad40\\div10=4$","En":"$40\\div8=5,\\quad40\\div10=4$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":5,"PrimarySkillId":24,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابحث عن عدد موجب يقبل القسمة على العددين.","En":"Find a positive number divisible by both numbers."},{"Ar":"اكتب مضاعفات العددين حتى تجد أول مضاعف مشترك.","En":"List multiples of both numbers until the first common one appears."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المضاعف المشترك الأصغر هو أصغر مضاعف موجب للعددين.","En":"The least common multiple is the smallest positive multiple of both numbers."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"القاسم المشترك الأكبر للعددين هو 2.","En":"The greatest common divisor is 2."},{"Ar":"اقسم حاصل الضرب على القاسم: $\\frac{8\\times10}{2}=40$.","En":"Divide the product by the GCD: $\\frac{8\\times10}{2}=40$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$40$","En":"$40$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط المضاعف المشترك بالقاسم المشترك.","En":"Do not confuse the common multiple with the common divisor."},"FormulaLatex":"\\operatorname{lcm}(a,b)=\\frac{|ab|}{\\gcd(a,b)}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{8\\times10}{2}=40$","En":"$\\frac{8\\times10}{2}=40$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$40\\div8=5,\\quad40\\div10=4$","En":"$40\\div8=5,\\quad40\\div10=4$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"باقيا قسمته على 8 و10 هما 1 و1؛ ليس مضاعفاً مشتركاً.","En":"Its remainders on division by 8 and 10 are 1 and 1; it is not a common multiple."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"باقيا قسمته على 8 و10 هما 3 و3؛ ليس مضاعفاً مشتركاً.","En":"Its remainders on division by 8 and 10 are 3 and 3; it is not a common multiple."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"باقيا قسمته على 8 و10 هما 6 و8؛ ليس مضاعفاً مشتركاً.","En":"Its remainders on division by 8 and 10 are 6 and 8; it is not a common multiple."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$المضاعف المشترك الأصغر هو أصغر مضاعف موجب للعددين.

$\operatorname{lcm}(a,b)=\frac{|ab|}{\gcd(a,b)}$

1. القاسم المشترك الأكبر للعددين هو 2.

2. اقسم حاصل الضرب على القاسم: $\frac{8\times10}{2}=40$.

$\frac{8\times10}{2}=40$

$40$ بلا وحدة قياس

$40\div8=5,\quad40\div10=4$

لا تخلط المضاعف المشترك بالقاسم المشترك.$mw$,$mw$The least common multiple is the smallest positive multiple of both numbers.

$\operatorname{lcm}(a,b)=\frac{|ab|}{\gcd(a,b)}$

1. The greatest common divisor is 2.

2. Divide the product by the GCD: $\frac{8\times10}{2}=40$.

$\frac{8\times10}{2}=40$

$40$ Dimensionless

$40\div8=5,\quad40\div10=4$

Do not confuse the common multiple with the common divisor.$mw$),
(426,215,$mw$1F5C43C14AD06EA21E56FDC34EC41374107501AF924E7ACF0D516988BC121E08$mw$,$mw$5380b5c947e0187c4a19ace15451c1df$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":215,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":7,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"خصم متجر 10% من ثمن 100، ما قيمة الخصم؟","TitleEn":"A store discounts 10% from a price of 100. Find the discount amount.","QuestionTextAr":"خصم متجر 10% من ثمن 100، ما قيمة الخصم؟","QuestionTextEn":"A store discounts 10% from a price of 100. Find the discount amount.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: مبلغ الخصم = السعر الأصلي × نسبة الخصم المئوية ÷ 100. السعر 100 وحدة والنسبة 10%، لذا الخصم = 100 × 10 ÷ 100 = 10 وحدة. السؤال يطلب قيمة الخصم فقط، وليس السعر بعد الخصم.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Discount amount = original price × discount percentage ÷ 100. Given 100 units and 10%, substitute: discount = 100 × 10 ÷ 100 = 10 units. The question asks for the discount amount, not the final sale price.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":849,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":850,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"11","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":851,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"13","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":852,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"النسبة المئوية تعني أجزاء من مئة.","En":"Percent means parts out of a hundred."},{"Ar":"اضرب السعر الأصلي في معدل الخصم المكتوب ككسر.","En":"Multiply the original price by the discount rate as a fraction."}],"Title":{"Ar":"خصم متجر 10% من ثمن 100، ما قيمة الخصم؟","En":"A store discounts 10% from a price of 100. Find the discount amount."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"10"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا المبلغ يمثل نسبة $\\frac{11}{100}\\times100\\%$، لا النسبة المطلوبة 10%.","En":"This amount represents $\\frac{11}{100}\\times100\\%$, not the required 10%."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"11"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا المبلغ يمثل نسبة $\\frac{13}{100}\\times100\\%$، لا النسبة المطلوبة 10%.","En":"This amount represents $\\frac{13}{100}\\times100\\%$, not the required 10%."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"13"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا المبلغ يمثل نسبة $\\frac{8}{100}\\times100\\%$، لا النسبة المطلوبة 10%.","En":"This amount represents $\\frac{8}{100}\\times100\\%$, not the required 10%."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"8"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"خصم متجر 10% من ثمن 100، ما قيمة الخصم؟","En":"A store discounts 10% from a price of 100. Find the discount amount."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قيمة الخصم تساوي السعر الأصلي مضروباً في النسبة المئوية بعد قسمتها على مئة.","En":"Discount amount equals the original price times the percentage rate divided by 100."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وحدة نقدية","En":"currency units"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حوّل النسبة إلى كسر: $\\frac{10}{100}$.","En":"Convert the rate to a fraction: $\\frac{10}{100}$."},{"Ar":"اضرب في السعر الأصلي 100 للحصول على مبلغ الخصم لا السعر النهائي.","En":"Multiply by the original price 100 to obtain the discount amount, not the final price."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$10$","En":"$10$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"قيمة الخصم ليست السعر بعد الخصم.","En":"The discount is not the final price."},"FormulaLatex":"D=P\\frac{r}{100}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$100\\times\\frac{10}{100}=10$","En":"$100\\times\\frac{10}{100}=10$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{10}{100}\\times100=10$","En":"$\\frac{10}{100}\\times100=10$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":7,"PrimarySkillId":32,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"النسبة المئوية تعني أجزاء من مئة.","En":"Percent means parts out of a hundred."},{"Ar":"اضرب السعر الأصلي في معدل الخصم المكتوب ككسر.","En":"Multiply the original price by the discount rate as a fraction."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قيمة الخصم تساوي السعر الأصلي مضروباً في النسبة المئوية بعد قسمتها على مئة.","En":"Discount amount equals the original price times the percentage rate divided by 100."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وحدة نقدية","En":"currency units"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حوّل النسبة إلى كسر: $\\frac{10}{100}$.","En":"Convert the rate to a fraction: $\\frac{10}{100}$."},{"Ar":"اضرب في السعر الأصلي 100 للحصول على مبلغ الخصم لا السعر النهائي.","En":"Multiply by the original price 100 to obtain the discount amount, not the final price."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$10$","En":"$10$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"قيمة الخصم ليست السعر بعد الخصم.","En":"The discount is not the final price."},"FormulaLatex":"D=P\\frac{r}{100}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$100\\times\\frac{10}{100}=10$","En":"$100\\times\\frac{10}{100}=10$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{10}{100}\\times100=10$","En":"$\\frac{10}{100}\\times100=10$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا المبلغ يمثل نسبة $\\frac{11}{100}\\times100\\%$، لا النسبة المطلوبة 10%.","En":"This amount represents $\\frac{11}{100}\\times100\\%$, not the required 10%."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا المبلغ يمثل نسبة $\\frac{13}{100}\\times100\\%$، لا النسبة المطلوبة 10%.","En":"This amount represents $\\frac{13}{100}\\times100\\%$, not the required 10%."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا المبلغ يمثل نسبة $\\frac{8}{100}\\times100\\%$، لا النسبة المطلوبة 10%.","En":"This amount represents $\\frac{8}{100}\\times100\\%$, not the required 10%."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$قيمة الخصم تساوي السعر الأصلي مضروباً في النسبة المئوية بعد قسمتها على مئة.

$D=P\frac{r}{100}$

1. حوّل النسبة إلى كسر: $\frac{10}{100}$.

2. اضرب في السعر الأصلي 100 للحصول على مبلغ الخصم لا السعر النهائي.

$100\times\frac{10}{100}=10$

$10$ وحدة نقدية

$\frac{10}{100}\times100=10$

قيمة الخصم ليست السعر بعد الخصم.$mw$,$mw$Discount amount equals the original price times the percentage rate divided by 100.

$D=P\frac{r}{100}$

1. Convert the rate to a fraction: $\frac{10}{100}$.

2. Multiply by the original price 100 to obtain the discount amount, not the final price.

$100\times\frac{10}{100}=10$

$10$ currency units

$\frac{10}{100}\times100=10$

The discount is not the final price.$mw$),
(427,216,$mw$0ABC02238ED7DFDA1F58F700E18AB8F7640627155CF07434846E72586B9F7F8C$mw$,$mw$e162b4c8470631efa1ba44b4fa7545be$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":216,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":7,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"مقياس خريطة: 1 سم يمثل 2 كم. كم يمثل 3 سم؟","TitleEn":"Map scale: 1 cm represents 2 km. What distance is 3 cm?","QuestionTextAr":"مقياس خريطة: 1 سم يمثل 2 كم. كم يمثل 3 سم؟","QuestionTextEn":"Map scale: 1 cm represents 2 km. What distance is 3 cm?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: المسافة الحقيقية = المسافة على الخريطة × قيمة مقياس الرسم لكل سنتيمتر. كل 1 سم يمثل 2 كم، والمسافة المرسومة 3 سم. بالتعويض: 3 × 2 = 6 كيلومتراً.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Actual distance = map distance × real distance represented by one centimetre. Each map centimetre means 2 km, and the measured map distance is 3 cm. Hence 3 × 2 = 6 km.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":853,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"7","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":854,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"9","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":855,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":856,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"كل سنتيمتر يمثل المسافة الحقيقية نفسها.","En":"Each centimeter represents the same real distance."},{"Ar":"اضرب المسافة التي يمثلها سنتيمتر واحد في عدد السنتيمترات المطلوبة.","En":"Multiply the real distance per centimeter by the map distance."}],"Title":{"Ar":"مقياس خريطة: 1 سم يمثل 2 كم. كم يمثل 3 سم؟","En":"Map scale: 1 cm represents 2 km. What distance is 3 cm?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"يعطي هذا الخيار $\\frac{7}{3}$ كم لكل سم، لا 2؛ لم يحافظ على المقياس.","En":"This gives $\\frac{7}{3}$ km per cm, not 2; the scale is not preserved."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"7"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"يعطي هذا الخيار $\\frac{9}{3}$ كم لكل سم، لا 2؛ لم يحافظ على المقياس.","En":"This gives $\\frac{9}{3}$ km per cm, not 2; the scale is not preserved."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"9"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"يعطي هذا الخيار $\\frac{4}{3}$ كم لكل سم، لا 2؛ لم يحافظ على المقياس.","En":"This gives $\\frac{4}{3}$ km per cm, not 2; the scale is not preserved."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"4"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"6"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"مقياس خريطة: 1 سم يمثل 2 كم. كم يمثل 3 سم؟","En":"Map scale: 1 cm represents 2 km. What distance is 3 cm?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المسافة الحقيقية تتناسب طردياً مع المسافة على الخريطة عند ثبات المقياس.","En":"Real distance is directly proportional to map distance at a fixed scale."},"Unit":{"Ar":"كم","En":"km"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدد المسافة الحقيقية لكل سنتيمتر: 2 كم.","En":"Find the actual distance per centimeter: 2 km."},{"Ar":"اضربها في طول الخريطة 3 سم: $2\\times3=6$.","En":"Multiply by the map length 3 cm: $2\\times3=6$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$6$","En":"$6$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط بين وحدتي المسافة على الخريطة والحقيقية.","En":"Do not confuse map and real-world distance units."},"FormulaLatex":"D=\\frac{d}{d_0}D_0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{2}{1}\\times3=6$","En":"$\\frac{2}{1}\\times3=6$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{6}{3}=\\frac{2}{1}$","En":"$\\frac{6}{3}=\\frac{2}{1}$"}},"TrackIds":[8],"CategoryId":7,"PrimarySkillId":33,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"كل سنتيمتر يمثل المسافة الحقيقية نفسها.","En":"Each centimeter represents the same real distance."},{"Ar":"اضرب المسافة التي يمثلها سنتيمتر واحد في عدد السنتيمترات المطلوبة.","En":"Multiply the real distance per centimeter by the map distance."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المسافة الحقيقية تتناسب طردياً مع المسافة على الخريطة عند ثبات المقياس.","En":"Real distance is directly proportional to map distance at a fixed scale."},"Unit":{"Ar":"كم","En":"km"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدد المسافة الحقيقية لكل سنتيمتر: 2 كم.","En":"Find the actual distance per centimeter: 2 km."},{"Ar":"اضربها في طول الخريطة 3 سم: $2\\times3=6$.","En":"Multiply by the map length 3 cm: $2\\times3=6$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$6$","En":"$6$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط بين وحدتي المسافة على الخريطة والحقيقية.","En":"Do not confuse map and real-world distance units."},"FormulaLatex":"D=\\frac{d}{d_0}D_0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{2}{1}\\times3=6$","En":"$\\frac{2}{1}\\times3=6$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{6}{3}=\\frac{2}{1}$","En":"$\\frac{6}{3}=\\frac{2}{1}$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"يعطي هذا الخيار $\\frac{7}{3}$ كم لكل سم، لا 2؛ لم يحافظ على المقياس.","En":"This gives $\\frac{7}{3}$ km per cm, not 2; the scale is not preserved."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"يعطي هذا الخيار $\\frac{9}{3}$ كم لكل سم، لا 2؛ لم يحافظ على المقياس.","En":"This gives $\\frac{9}{3}$ km per cm, not 2; the scale is not preserved."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"يعطي هذا الخيار $\\frac{4}{3}$ كم لكل سم، لا 2؛ لم يحافظ على المقياس.","En":"This gives $\\frac{4}{3}$ km per cm, not 2; the scale is not preserved."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$المسافة الحقيقية تتناسب طردياً مع المسافة على الخريطة عند ثبات المقياس.

$D=\frac{d}{d_0}D_0$

1. حدد المسافة الحقيقية لكل سنتيمتر: 2 كم.

2. اضربها في طول الخريطة 3 سم: $2\times3=6$.

$\frac{2}{1}\times3=6$

$6$ كم

$\frac{6}{3}=\frac{2}{1}$

لا تخلط بين وحدتي المسافة على الخريطة والحقيقية.$mw$,$mw$Real distance is directly proportional to map distance at a fixed scale.

$D=\frac{d}{d_0}D_0$

1. Find the actual distance per centimeter: 2 km.

2. Multiply by the map length 3 cm: $2\times3=6$.

$\frac{2}{1}\times3=6$

$6$ km

$\frac{6}{3}=\frac{2}{1}$

Do not confuse map and real-world distance units.$mw$),
(428,217,$mw$ACFACDE7B719123A9087A2BF548340453341F2E6E2A6CD16764DC6B9A9DDD953$mw$,$mw$86dc4dbd4d79661154d4f355370a6f29$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":217,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":7,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"إذا ارتفع سعر 40 بنسبة 25%، فما السعر الجديد؟","TitleEn":"If 40 increases by 25%, what is the new price?","QuestionTextAr":"إذا ارتفع سعر 40 بنسبة 25%، فما السعر الجديد؟","QuestionTextEn":"If 40 increases by 25%, what is the new price?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: القيمة الجديدة بعد زيادة نسبتها 25% = القيمة الأصلية + (القيمة الأصلية × 25 ÷ 100). في هذه المسألة الأصل 40؛ مقدار الزيادة = 40 × 25 ÷ 100 = 10. إذن القيمة الجديدة = 40 + 10 = 50.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: New value after a 25% increase = original value + original × 25/100. Starting at 40, compute the increase 40 × 25/100 = 10. Add it to the original: 40 + 10 = 50.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":857,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"53","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":858,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"48","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":859,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"50","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":860,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"51","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ميّز مقدار الزيادة عن السعر النهائي.","En":"Distinguish the increase from the final price."},{"Ar":"احسب الزيادة كنسبة من السعر الأصلي ثم أضفها إليه.","En":"Find the increase as a percentage of the original price, then add it."}],"Title":{"Ar":"إذا ارتفع سعر 40 بنسبة 25%، فما السعر الجديد؟","En":"If 40 increases by 25%, what is the new price?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"فرق هذا السعر عن الأصل هو 13، بينما الزيادة المطلوبة 10.","En":"This price differs from the original by 13, but the required increase is 10."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"53"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"فرق هذا السعر عن الأصل هو 8، بينما الزيادة المطلوبة 10.","En":"This price differs from the original by 8, but the required increase is 10."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"48"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"50"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"فرق هذا السعر عن الأصل هو 11، بينما الزيادة المطلوبة 10.","En":"This price differs from the original by 11, but the required increase is 10."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"51"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"إذا ارتفع سعر 40 بنسبة 25%، فما السعر الجديد؟","En":"If 40 increases by 25%, what is the new price?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"السعر الجديد يساوي السعر الأصلي مضافاً إليه مقدار الزيادة.","En":"The new price equals the original price plus the increase."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وحدة نقدية","En":"Currency units"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"احسب الزيادة: $40\\times\\frac{25}{100}=10$.","En":"Calculate the increase: $40\\times\\frac{25}{100}=10$."},{"Ar":"أضف الزيادة للسعر الأصلي: $40+10=50$.","En":"Add the increase to the original price: $40+10=50$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$50$","En":"$50$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تكتف بحساب مقدار الزيادة؛ المطلوب السعر الجديد.","En":"Do not report only the increase; the question asks for the new price."},"FormulaLatex":"P_{\\mathrm{new}}=P\\left(1+\\frac{r}{100}\\right)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$40+40\\times\\frac{25}{100}=40+10=50$","En":"$40+40\\times\\frac{25}{100}=40+10=50$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{50-40}{40}\\times100=25$","En":"$\\frac{50-40}{40}\\times100=25$"}},"TrackIds":[8],"CategoryId":7,"PrimarySkillId":34,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ميّز مقدار الزيادة عن السعر النهائي.","En":"Distinguish the increase from the final price."},{"Ar":"احسب الزيادة كنسبة من السعر الأصلي ثم أضفها إليه.","En":"Find the increase as a percentage of the original price, then add it."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"السعر الجديد يساوي السعر الأصلي مضافاً إليه مقدار الزيادة.","En":"The new price equals the original price plus the increase."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وحدة نقدية","En":"Currency units"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"احسب الزيادة: $40\\times\\frac{25}{100}=10$.","En":"Calculate the increase: $40\\times\\frac{25}{100}=10$."},{"Ar":"أضف الزيادة للسعر الأصلي: $40+10=50$.","En":"Add the increase to the original price: $40+10=50$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$50$","En":"$50$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تكتف بحساب مقدار الزيادة؛ المطلوب السعر الجديد.","En":"Do not report only the increase; the question asks for the new price."},"FormulaLatex":"P_{\\mathrm{new}}=P\\left(1+\\frac{r}{100}\\right)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$40+40\\times\\frac{25}{100}=40+10=50$","En":"$40+40\\times\\frac{25}{100}=40+10=50$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{50-40}{40}\\times100=25$","En":"$\\frac{50-40}{40}\\times100=25$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"فرق هذا السعر عن الأصل هو 13، بينما الزيادة المطلوبة 10.","En":"This price differs from the original by 13, but the required increase is 10."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"فرق هذا السعر عن الأصل هو 8، بينما الزيادة المطلوبة 10.","En":"This price differs from the original by 8, but the required increase is 10."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"فرق هذا السعر عن الأصل هو 11، بينما الزيادة المطلوبة 10.","En":"This price differs from the original by 11, but the required increase is 10."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$السعر الجديد يساوي السعر الأصلي مضافاً إليه مقدار الزيادة.

$P_{\mathrm{new}}=P\left(1+\frac{r}{100}\right)$

1. احسب الزيادة: $40\times\frac{25}{100}=10$.

2. أضف الزيادة للسعر الأصلي: $40+10=50$.

$40+40\times\frac{25}{100}=40+10=50$

$50$ وحدة نقدية

$\frac{50-40}{40}\times100=25$

لا تكتف بحساب مقدار الزيادة؛ المطلوب السعر الجديد.$mw$,$mw$The new price equals the original price plus the increase.

$P_{\mathrm{new}}=P\left(1+\frac{r}{100}\right)$

1. Calculate the increase: $40\times\frac{25}{100}=10$.

2. Add the increase to the original price: $40+10=50$.

$40+40\times\frac{25}{100}=40+10=50$

$50$ Currency units

$\frac{50-40}{40}\times100=25$

Do not report only the increase; the question asks for the new price.$mw$),
(430,219,$mw$9535AA692155A09AE4F6D0FF1AA70A54602C23410DDEF28867263E53A5EDC2C1$mw$,$mw$1833a9e271634a310145e5ffc237287d$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":219,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":34,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"وتر مثلث قائم 5، وأحد ضلعيه 3. ما الضلع الثاني؟","TitleEn":"A right triangle has hypotenuse 5 and one leg 3. Find its other leg.","QuestionTextAr":"وتر مثلث قائم 5، وأحد ضلعيه 3. ما الضلع الثاني؟","QuestionTextEn":"A right triangle has hypotenuse 5 and one leg 3. Find its other leg.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: في المثلث القائم أ² + ب² = ج²، حيث ج هو الوتر الأطول. لإيجاد الضلع المجهول ب نعكس القانون: ب = √(ج² − أ²). الوتر 5 والضلع 3؛ بالتعويض: ب = √(25 − 9) = √16 = 4. نأخذ الجذر الموجب لأن الطول غير سالب.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: In a right triangle a² + b² = c², where c is the hypotenuse. Rearrange to find the unknown leg: b = √(c² − a²). Given c = 5, a = 3, calculate b = √(25 − 9) = √16 = 4. Take the positive root since length is nonnegative.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":865,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"7","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":866,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"3","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":867,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":868,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"طبّق نظرية فيثاغورس مع اعتبار الوتر أطول ضلع.","En":"Use Pythagoras' theorem with the hypotenuse as the longest side."},{"Ar":"اعزل مربع الضلع المجهول ثم خذ الجذر الموجب.","En":"Isolate the square of the unknown leg, then take the positive root."}],"Title":{"Ar":"وتر مثلث قائم 5، وأحد ضلعيه 3. ما الضلع الثاني؟","En":"A right triangle has hypotenuse 5 and one leg 3. Find its other leg."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"بالتعويض نحصل على $3^2+7^2=58$ وليس 25؛ لا تتحقق فيثاغورس.","En":"Substitution gives $3^2+7^2=58$, not 25; Pythagoras does not hold."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"7"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"بالتعويض نحصل على $3^2+3^2=18$ وليس 25؛ لا تتحقق فيثاغورس.","En":"Substitution gives $3^2+3^2=18$, not 25; Pythagoras does not hold."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"3"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"4"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"بالتعويض نحصل على $3^2+5^2=34$ وليس 25؛ لا تتحقق فيثاغورس.","En":"Substitution gives $3^2+5^2=34$, not 25; Pythagoras does not hold."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"5"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"وتر مثلث قائم 5، وأحد ضلعيه 3. ما الضلع الثاني؟","En":"A right triangle has hypotenuse 5 and one leg 3. Find its other leg."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"عند معرفة الوتر وأحد ضلعي القائمة نطرح مربع الضلع المعلوم من مربع الوتر.","En":"When the hypotenuse and one leg are known, subtract the square of the known leg from the hypotenuse squared."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وحدة طول","En":"Length units"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"اطرح مربعي الوتر والضلع المعلوم: $5^2-3^2=16$.","En":"Subtract the known leg's square from the hypotenuse's square: $5^2-3^2=16$."},{"Ar":"خذ الجذر الموجب لأن طول الضلع موجب: $\\sqrt{16}=4$.","En":"Take the positive root because side length is positive: $\\sqrt{16}=4$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$4$","En":"$4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"الجمع بين المربعين يُستخدم لإيجاد الوتر لا الضلع القائم المجهول.","En":"Adding the squares finds the hypotenuse, not an unknown leg."},"FormulaLatex":"c^2=a^2+b^2\\Rightarrow b=\\sqrt{c^2-a^2}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\sqrt{5^2-3^2}=\\sqrt{16}=4$","En":"$\\sqrt{5^2-3^2}=\\sqrt{16}=4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$3^2+4^2=5^2$","En":"$3^2+4^2=5^2$"}},"TrackIds":[8],"CategoryId":34,"PrimarySkillId":37,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"طبّق نظرية فيثاغورس مع اعتبار الوتر أطول ضلع.","En":"Use Pythagoras' theorem with the hypotenuse as the longest side."},{"Ar":"اعزل مربع الضلع المجهول ثم خذ الجذر الموجب.","En":"Isolate the square of the unknown leg, then take the positive root."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"عند معرفة الوتر وأحد ضلعي القائمة نطرح مربع الضلع المعلوم من مربع الوتر.","En":"When the hypotenuse and one leg are known, subtract the square of the known leg from the hypotenuse squared."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وحدة طول","En":"Length units"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"اطرح مربعي الوتر والضلع المعلوم: $5^2-3^2=16$.","En":"Subtract the known leg's square from the hypotenuse's square: $5^2-3^2=16$."},{"Ar":"خذ الجذر الموجب لأن طول الضلع موجب: $\\sqrt{16}=4$.","En":"Take the positive root because side length is positive: $\\sqrt{16}=4$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$4$","En":"$4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"الجمع بين المربعين يُستخدم لإيجاد الوتر لا الضلع القائم المجهول.","En":"Adding the squares finds the hypotenuse, not an unknown leg."},"FormulaLatex":"c^2=a^2+b^2\\Rightarrow b=\\sqrt{c^2-a^2}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\sqrt{5^2-3^2}=\\sqrt{16}=4$","En":"$\\sqrt{5^2-3^2}=\\sqrt{16}=4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$3^2+4^2=5^2$","En":"$3^2+4^2=5^2$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"بالتعويض نحصل على $3^2+7^2=58$ وليس 25؛ لا تتحقق فيثاغورس.","En":"Substitution gives $3^2+7^2=58$, not 25; Pythagoras does not hold."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"بالتعويض نحصل على $3^2+3^2=18$ وليس 25؛ لا تتحقق فيثاغورس.","En":"Substitution gives $3^2+3^2=18$, not 25; Pythagoras does not hold."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"بالتعويض نحصل على $3^2+5^2=34$ وليس 25؛ لا تتحقق فيثاغورس.","En":"Substitution gives $3^2+5^2=34$, not 25; Pythagoras does not hold."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$عند معرفة الوتر وأحد ضلعي القائمة نطرح مربع الضلع المعلوم من مربع الوتر.

$c^2=a^2+b^2\Rightarrow b=\sqrt{c^2-a^2}$

1. اطرح مربعي الوتر والضلع المعلوم: $5^2-3^2=16$.

2. خذ الجذر الموجب لأن طول الضلع موجب: $\sqrt{16}=4$.

$\sqrt{5^2-3^2}=\sqrt{16}=4$

$4$ وحدة طول

$3^2+4^2=5^2$

الجمع بين المربعين يُستخدم لإيجاد الوتر لا الضلع القائم المجهول.$mw$,$mw$When the hypotenuse and one leg are known, subtract the square of the known leg from the hypotenuse squared.

$c^2=a^2+b^2\Rightarrow b=\sqrt{c^2-a^2}$

1. Subtract the known leg's square from the hypotenuse's square: $5^2-3^2=16$.

2. Take the positive root because side length is positive: $\sqrt{16}=4$.

$\sqrt{5^2-3^2}=\sqrt{16}=4$

$4$ Length units

$3^2+4^2=5^2$

Adding the squares finds the hypotenuse, not an unknown leg.$mw$);
